{"id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-term.md","title":"项 Term","display":"df-term — 项 Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-term","aliases":["29-df-term"],"display":"df-term — 项 Term","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term — 项 Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-term-—-项-$\\mathrm{Term}_S$\">df-term — 项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{Term}_S \\coloneqq \\bigcap\\left\\{T \\middle| \\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\{c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\}\\subseteq T\\ \\land\\ \\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;\\forall t_1,\\ldots,t_{r_k}\\in T\\;\\bigl(f_k(t_1,\\ldots,t_{r_k})\\in T\\bigr)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{Term}_S \\coloneqq \\bigcap\\left\\{T \\middle| \\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\{c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\}\\subseteq T\\ \\land\\ \\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;\\forall t_1,\\ldots,t_{r_k}\\in T\\;\\bigl(f_k(t_1,\\ldots,t_{r_k})\\in T\\bigr)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> : 所有S-项的集合</li>\n<li>项包括变量和函数项</li>\n<li>项在结构中可被解释为论域中的元素</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-term-—-项-$\\mathrm{Term}_S$","text":"df-term — 项 $\\mathrm{Term}_S$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ (see [[29-df-vocab]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-var